  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Maalraas</defName>
    <label>maalraas</label>
    <description>Maalraas (or 'Nighthunters') were a non-sentient species of predatory quadrupeds of unknown planetary origin. Maalraas hunted in packs, primarily preying upon cannoks and other small creatures. It is believed they used "the force" to assist in camouflaging themselves from both predator and prey. For a time they had heightened popularity with several crime syndicates as attack beasts which resulted in the species being spread to numerous worlds.</description>
